removes: the call is made again over the port the refused credential's source was built on, so the credential read again is never used
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill
tests: TestARefusedCallUsesTheCredentialTheOperatorStored/the_first_pass TestARefusedCallUsesTheCredentialTheOperatorStored/the_second_pass
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

